{"id":"wb-4-116","name":"牛王庙戏台","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"牛王庙戏台","text":"牛王庙戏台位于中国山西省临汾市尧都区魏村镇，建于元代，一度曾被认为是现存最古老的木结构戏台（2002年发现确认建于金代的高平二郎庙戏台为最古例），1996年被列为第四批全国重点文物保护单位。\n牛王庙坐北朝南，现存三王殿、献亭、垛殿、廊庑、戏台等建筑，除戏台外均为明清建筑。戏台建于元至元二十年（1283年），大德七年（1303年）因平阳地震受损，至治元年（1321年）重修。戏台面宽7.45米，进深7.55米，单檐歇山顶，三面敞开，仅后檐及两山后部砌墙。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%89%9B%E7%8E%8B%E5%BA%99%E6%88%8F%E5%8F%B0","revisionId":91021652,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91021652","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/b591223a670a94b431ea7fba.jpg","title":"牛王庙戏台2.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%89%9B%E7%8E%8B%E5%BA%99%E6%88%8F%E5%8F%B02.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5d/%E7%89%9B%E7%8E%8B%E5%BA%99%E6%88%8F%E5%8F%B02.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"三猎","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​牛王庙戏台。","width":320,"height":180}}